OL,3,GNEWSA'I love the sheep and the people'
OL,4,A- Knitters flock to Shetland's wool
OL,5,Aweek
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost 1,000 people have gathered in
OL,8,FShetland for the island's annual
OL,9,Fcelebration of wool, knitting and
OL,10,Ftextiles.
OL,12,FThe week-long event is marking its 17th
OL,13,Fyear and features classes, workshops,
OL,14,Ftalks, tours and social activities.
OL,16,FShetland Wool Week draws enthusiasts
OL,17,Ffrom around the world, including the US
OL,18,Fand Japan.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
