OL,3,GNEWSA'I love the sheep and the people'
OL,4,A- Knitters flock to Shetland's wool
OL,5,Aweek
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis year's patron, knitwear designer
OL,8,FHelen Robertson, said: "I think wool
OL,9,Fweek is just such a fantastic
OL,10,Forganisation and festival, and it's
OL,11,Freally brought Shetland textiles to
OL,12,Flife."
